    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναφρόδῑ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀφροδίτη,</span>
			<i>not enjoying her favours,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.751e
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἰς τὰ ἐρωτικά</span>
			<i>unlucky</i> in . ., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				15.2
			</span></i>; <i>love-less,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					7.133
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>insensible to love,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.57d
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				347c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>without charms,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gell.
				1.5.3
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
